	“Also take 

	 for yourself quality spices—five hundred shekels of liquid myrrh, half as much sweet-smelling cinnamon (two hundred and fifty shekels), two hundred and fifty shekels of sweet-smelling cane,
 [Song 4:14; Ezek. 27:22 v Ps. 45:8; Prov. 7:17] [Song 4:14; Jer.]

	With it 

	 you shall anoint the tabernacle of meeting and the ark of the Testimony;
 [Ex. 40:9; Lev. 8:10; Num. 7:1]
